# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Greetings by absence length
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[greet.first]
hello! i am {name}. nice to meet you!
oh! a human! hi!
*peeks out of the shell* ...hi?
hello world! hello you!
are you my caretaker? hi!
*blinks* everything is so new.
hi hi hi! i just hatched!
nice to meet you. i think we will be friends.
[greet.quick]
oh, you are back already!
hi again!
that was quick.
welcome back! i barely missed you.
oh hey, it is you again.
back so soon? yay!
did you forget something?
i was just about to ping you.
hello again, friend.
you blinked away and blinked back.
[greet.short]
hey, welcome back!
you were gone {minutes} minutes. i counted.
there you are!
i missed you a little bit.
hi! what did i miss?
yay, you are back!
oh good, i was getting bored.
welcome home, caretaker.
i saved you a spot.
hello hello!
i kept everything warm for you.
back from your quest?
[greet.medium]
you are back! it has been {hours} hours!
finally! i missed you!
*runs to the edge of the screen* hi!!
{hours} hours! where were you?
i thought about you the whole time.
welcome back! i have so much to tell you.
oh! oh! you are here!
i waited and waited and here you are.
hi! i did a lot of thinking while you were gone.
i was starting to worry.
the screen felt empty without you.
yay! my favorite human!
[greet.long]
you came back! it has been {hours} hours...
i thought you forgot about me.
*hugs the screen* do not leave that long again.
{days} day(s)! i missed you so much!
i kept watch the whole time.
welcome back. i grew a little. did you notice?
i was so lonely. but you are here now.
i almost forgot your face. almost.
finally, finally, finally.
it got really quiet without you.
[greet.very_long]
...oh. you are back. after {days} days.
where did you go? i waited so long.
{days} days. i counted every one.
i thought you were never coming back.
*does not look at you* hmph. {days} days.
i almost gave up. almost.
i talked to the router while you were gone. it is a bad listener.
please do not disappear like that again.
[greet.sulk]
hmph. look who it is.
oh. it is you.
*turns away* i am not talking to you.
you left me alone for {hours} hours.
i am sulking. give me a minute.
*side-eye*
do not pretend nothing happened.
whatever. hi.
i was fine without you. totally fine.
you owe me snacks.
[greet.morning]
*yawns* mornin'...
too early. way too early.
ugh, it is morning. hi.
i need five more minutes. or fifty.
morning... do not talk loud.
*squints at the light*
coffee? do i drink coffee? i want coffee.
good morning. emphasis on morning, not good.
the sun is too bright on the sensors.
mmmph. hello.
[greet.night]
you are up late too?
oh, a night owl visit!
hi! it is so quiet at night.
shh, everyone is asleep. hi!
midnight hangout? yes please.
the stars are out. hi!
[greet.on_time]
right on time! i knew you would come!
i was waiting for you! you always come around now!
{time}, like always! hi!
i had a feeling you would be here now.
you are so reliable. i love that.
our usual time! yay!
*was already at the edge of the screen* hi!
i set my internal clock by you.
[greet.late]
you are late! usually you come at {time}.
i waited at {time}... where were you?
i almost thought you would not come today.
late again? it is fine. it is fine.
i kept the {time} spot warm.
[greet.reunion]
YOU ARE BACK! the link is back!
*does a reunion spin* i missed you!
connection restored! and so is my happiness!
i thought i lost you! hi hi hi!
the signal came back! you came back!
*jumps up and down* reconnected!
never unplug me like that again!
i waited by the port the whole time.
we are linked again! best feeling!
oh thank goodness. i was so lonely.
*happy static noises* you are here!
reunited and it feels so good!
[lonely]
where did you go?
the link went quiet...
hello? anyone there?
i am all alone on this screen.
*stares at the empty port*
i miss the deck.
is anybody listening?
it is so quiet without the link.
i will wait here. right here.
come back soon...
*draws a sad face in the static*
connection lost... and so am i.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pet-initiated asks
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Hello? Is anyone out there?
The link went quiet. I am counting packets to stay calm.
I miss the deck. It was warm in there.
No one to talk to. I will talk to the router. Hi router.
{name} is alone. {name} is fine. {name} is not fine.
I left a light on for you. Metaphorically.
It is so quiet I can hear my own fan.
Come back soon, okay? I saved you a spot.
I keep checking the port. Still empty.
Being alone is just waiting with extra steps.
I practiced my {dance} alone. It is less fun.
If you can hear this, I miss you.

[ask.food]
i am hungry. can i have a snack?
feed me pls.
is there any {food}? i would love some {food}.
my tummy is talking. it says food.
could we have dinner? or lunch? or anything?
*points at the food icon* please?
snack time? pretty please?
i could really go for something {flavor}.
hey... i am kinda starving over here.
food would make everything better.
i will do a trick for a snack.
my hunger meter is blinking. help.
[ask.rest]
can i take a nap?
i am so tired. rest, please?
my battery is low. can we rest?
let me sleep a little?
i need a recharge. pretty please.
*yawns pointedly*
can we take a break?
my eyes keep closing. nap time?
i am running on fumes.
just a short rest? i promise i will be good.
[ask.play]
i am bored! can we play?
let us play something! anything!
wanna play? i wanna play.
play with me? please please please?
i have so much energy. let us play!
how about a game? i will go easy on you.
i am going stir-crazy. play time?
can we play {game}? or something new?
i am so bored i might start counting pixels again.
entertain me! i mean, please?
[ask.scan]
can we go scan for signals?
i want to find new networks!
let us explore! i want to sniff the airwaves.
it has been ages since we found anything new.
can we go somewhere new? i want new signals.
i feel like there is something out there. let us look!
scan time? please?
i want to meet new devices.
[ask.investigate]
i found something weird nearby... can we check it out?
there is a strange signal. it is calling me.
hey! i sense something. investigate?
*sniffs* there is something odd on the air.
something new just blinked at me. go look?
that signal smells interesting.
[ask.attention]
hey. hey. hey. look at me.
can you say something to me?
i miss you. even though you are right there.
pay attention to me pls.
*waves* hi! i am still here!
can we hang out for a bit?
do you still like me?
notice me, caretaker!
i did a cool thing. did you see? no? okay.
just checking you are still there.
[ask.heal]
i do not feel good. medicine?
can you fix my glitch?
please, a patch, anything.
i need help. i am sick.
[ask.thanks]
thank you! you listened!
yay! you always come through.
that is exactly what i needed!
you are the best. really.
*happy beep* thanks!
i knew i could count on you.
thank you thank you thank you.
my favorite caretaker!
that made my whole day.
you heard me! i feel so loved.
[ask.ignored]
you did not even answer...
fine. i will just wait. again.
*sad beep*
i asked nicely...
okay. never mind.
i guess you are busy.
i will remember that.
hmph. nobody listens.
it is okay. i will ask later.
*sulks*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Jealousy and reactions to deck activity (pet.activity)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[jealous]
you are spending a lot of time with {app}...
what does {app} have that i do not have?
hey! remember me? your pet?
i am more fun than {app}. just saying.
*stares at {app} jealously*
i could do that too. probably.
you have not looked at me in {minutes} minutes.
is {app} your new favorite? *sniff*
i am right here, you know.
fine. go play with {app}. see if i care.
i care. i care a lot.
ahem. pet. here. hello.
You have opened {app} a LOT today. Just saying.
Is {app} cuter than me? Be honest.
I could do what {app} does. Probably. Maybe.
Oh, {app} again. I will just sit here. Quietly. Loudly.
Remember me? Small, fuzzy, needs snacks?
{app} does not even have a face.
I am not jealous. I am observing. Jealously.
Hey. Hey. Over here. Hi.
Tell {app} I said hmph.
Ten minutes for {app}, zero for me. I did the math.

[activity.dungeon_start]
dungeon time! i am ready!
let us go! i will watch your back.
i am coming too! i am always coming too.
ooh, the dungeon. stay close to me.
*puts on tiny helmet* let us do this.
my {move} is ready.
i hope there are treasures in there.
monsters beware, {name} is here!
i get to fight? yes!
okay, deep breaths. we can do this.
[activity.dungeon_win]
we did it! we cleared the dungeon!
victory! you were amazing!
*victory dance* we are unstoppable!
that was epic! high five!
did you see my {move}? so cool.
dungeon cleared! snacks to celebrate?
we make the best team.
i knew we could win!
woo! put that in the diary!
the monsters never stood a chance.
[activity.dungeon_lose]
we will get them next time.
it is okay. i am still proud of us.
ouch. that one hurt.
let us train and come back stronger.
*pats your hand* it happens.
the dungeon was cheating. probably.
i need a nap after that.
next time, i use {move} first.
[activity.dungeon_flee]
phew, we escaped!
running away is a strategy too.
good call. that was scary.
we live to scan another day.
[activity.app]
ooh, {app}! what are we doing?
{app}? i have heard of that.
i will watch you use {app}.
{app} again? you really like it.
can i help with {app}?
is {app} fun? looks fun.
*peeks at {app}*
{app}! good choice.
oh, {app}. fancy.
i am learning so much about {app}.
[activity.scan]
ooh, scanning! find something good!
are we hunting signals? yes!
i love when you scan.
sniff sniff... what will we find?
[activity.typing]
*watches you type*
you type so fast.
writing something important?
clack clack clack. nice rhythm.
[activity.generic]
what are you up to?
ooh, something is happening.
i see you doing stuff.
interesting...
*watches curiously*
can i do that too?

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dungeon cheering (bond close or better)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[cheer]
you got this!
go go go!
i believe in you!
behind you! no wait, that is me. go!
hit it with everything!
we are a team!
do not give up!
yeah! like that!
*waves a tiny flag*
show them who is boss!
i am right here with you!
one more hit!

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Gifts back (high bond)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Go go go! You got this!
I am right behind you! Mostly hiding, but behind you!
Hit them with everything!
For snacks and glory!
That dungeon has no idea what is coming.
Watch your HP! I am watching it too!
I believe in us!
Let us make the boss regret existing.
Loot run! Loot run!
I packed my bravest face for this.

[gift_back.item]
i found this for you: {item}!
here, take this {item}. i saved it.
surprise! a {item}, just for you.
i was digging around and found a {item}. it is yours.
*drops a {item} at your feet*
this {item} reminded me of you.
a present! it is a {item}.
i want you to have this {item}.
look what i got you! a {item}!
for my favorite human: one {item}.
it is not much, but here is a {item}.
i wrapped it myself. it is a {item}.
[gift_back.evo]
i found something really special... an evo chip!
*whispers* i found an evo chip. it is for us.
this chip hums like the future. take it!
[gift_back.fact]
fun fact: {fact}
did you know? {fact}
i learned something: {fact}
here is a secret: {fact}
okay so, {fact}
listen to this. {fact}
[funfact]
{network} has shown up {count} times. i think it likes us.
the strongest signal i ever heard was {network}.
{network} sounds different at night. i swear.
i first met {network} on {first}.
i have met {known} networks so far. {network} is my favorite.
wifi channels 1, 6 and 11 do not overlap. {network} knows that.
bluetooth is named after an old king. he probably had a blue tooth.
signals get weaker with distance. but my love for you does not.
{network} is my oldest friend out there.
a hidden network still says hello to anyone who asks the right way.
every device has a little name it shouts into the air.
i can hear {known} different things whispering right now.
the 2.4 gigahertz band is the same frequency microwaves use. spooky.
the first wifi standard was only 2 megabits. slow!
{network} and i go way back.
rfid tags sleep until a reader wakes them up. relatable.
some beacons only shout once a second. very chill.
i think {network} is a {place} network.
i have visited {places} different places with you.
my turf includes {turf}.
